      en: ["The reserve was officially established on July 26, 1979.", "The total protected area covers 49,389 hectares.", "Approximately 60% of the area consists of mangrove ecosystems.", "Over 300 bird species have been recorded within its borders.", "It was designated as a Ramsar Wetland of International Importance in 1990.", "The highest hills in the reserve reach an elevation of about 600 meters."],
