      en: ["The protected forest was officially established in 1989.", "It covers a total area of approximately 6,078 hectares.", "More than 200 distinct bird species inhabit the forest.", "It is the primary sanctuary for the critically endangered Great Green Macaw.", "There are four major nature trails designed for ecotourism and education.", "The forest is privately managed by the Pro-Bosque Foundation."],
